## BIP-39 — `src/bip39_vectors.zig`

The vectors are the widely-used "Trezor" English set, and they come from an
implementation repository, not from the BIP: `trezor/python-mnemonic`'s
`vectors.json`, `english` section — entropy, mnemonic, and the 64-byte seed
derived with the fixed passphrase "TREZOR" this set standardizes on.

